PC PC_Buzzer @ Buzzer
   process Buzzer  @ Muted
   process Muted  @ buzz
   after buzz->Buzzing
   atom :'buzz' 
   after Buzzing->Muted
   process Buzzing  @ Ref27ef2419
   import PC_Timer as I26cf5bdc for PC_Timer
   reference Ref27ef2419 : Timer('3')[timeout/mute]
   ref_connector Ref27ef2419->I26cf5bdc
